WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:05.520
So Donald Trump's casual musings about the&nbsp;
potential to declare martial law reportedly&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:05.520 --> 00:00:10.640
have the military on red alert, but not on red&nbsp;
alert to participate in enforcing the martial law.&nbsp;

00:00:11.280 --> 00:00:17.760
In fact, it's quite the opposite. The military&nbsp;
is not on red alert, preparing to enforce martial&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:17.760 --> 00:00:25.040
law, which is a suspension of civil law in lieu&nbsp;
of military justice becoming the law of the land.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:25.040 --> 00:00:30.000
The military is on red alert not because&nbsp;
they want to be prepared to help Trump.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:37.360
They want to be prepared in case protesters go&nbsp;
so crazy if Trump tries to install martial law&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:37.360 --> 00:00:43.840
that the military might be required to help&nbsp;
quell violence and restore order. Multiple&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:43.840 --> 00:00:50.000
officers who spoke to Newsweek, of course, on&nbsp;
the condition of anonymity, agree that there's no&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:56.080
chance whatsoever that the military would actually&nbsp;
try to help Donald Trump overturn the results or&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:56.080 --> 00:01:02.320
enforce the martial law that Trump is supposedly&nbsp;
using and wondering about. But with the military&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:02.320 --> 00:01:07.840
officers are worried about, is that by trying&nbsp;
to push martial law, if Trump were to do it,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:08.400 --> 00:01:13.920
that the military could end up getting sucked&nbsp;
into having to clean up the mess that Donald Trump&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:13.920 --> 00:01:19.520
might make. And the thought is that Donald&nbsp;
Trump could inadvertently or deliberately&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:19.520 --> 00:01:25.360
rally so-called private militias and pro Trump&nbsp;
paramilitary types, and the military could&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:25.360 --> 00:01:31.360
end up being needed to help protect from those&nbsp;
groups. Now, the consensus is that there is no&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:32.160 --> 00:01:38.400
group or contingent or cabal of military officers&nbsp;
that would actually go with Donald Trump's idea.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:38.400 --> 00:01:42.400
But the military could end up needing to come&nbsp;
to the defense of the people depending on what&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:42.400 --> 00:01:46.880
happens. And notably, the contingency&nbsp;
planning is happening completely out&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:46.880 --> 00:01:51.680
of sight of the White House and the known&nbsp;
Trump loyalists at the Pentagon, because&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:51.680 --> 00:01:56.720
the military recognizes that if you involve the&nbsp;
White House or Trump loyalists in the Pentagon&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:57.360 --> 00:02:02.160
in and let them know that you're planning in this&nbsp;
way, they may actually try to interfere with what&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:02.160 --> 00:02:07.840
you're doing or even notify Donald Trump. And&nbsp;
along those lines, the other crazy aspect of this&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:08.880 --> 00:02:16.480
is that top military brass understand that&nbsp;
if they publicly said we would never support&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:16.480 --> 00:02:20.880
any attempt at martial law because&nbsp;
Trump thinks he really won when he lost,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:22.640 --> 00:02:29.040
they recognize that if they went public with their&nbsp;
names, it could make Trump go absolutely crazy&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:29.040 --> 00:02:34.960
and make him more likely to try this stuff. So the&nbsp;
reporting is that the military officer community&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:34.960 --> 00:02:41.200
is just kind of laying low contingency planning&nbsp;
out of sight, but not attaching their names to any&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:41.200 --> 00:02:47.360
specific public rebukes of Donald Trump's martial&nbsp;
law musings. And to be frank, I understand that.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:47.360 --> 00:02:52.080
And the question comes up of whether Donald&nbsp;
Trump, absent support from the military,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:53.040 --> 00:03:00.640
would try to pull in Blackwater type mercenary&nbsp;
groups or others, which would be just a new&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:00.640 --> 00:03:06.720
level of insanity. And hopefully it will never&nbsp;
come to that. Donald Trump just went to Florida&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:07.280 --> 00:03:13.120
for the holiday. And there's the idea that Trump&nbsp;
may never even come back to Washington, D.C.,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:13.120 --> 00:03:17.840
like you may just stay in Florida. This will all&nbsp;
fade away and be nothing or not. We don't know.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:19.200 --> 00:03:23.920
I've actually already left the country. I've not&nbsp;
even been in the U.S. for a bit. I'm not going&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:23.920 --> 00:03:28.720
to be back until after the inauguration. The&nbsp;
show will look the same. I've been mentioning,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:28.720 --> 00:03:32.640
you know, multiple studios lately. Nothing will&nbsp;
change when we get back from New Year's break.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:33.280 --> 00:03:36.800
But I'm beating the rush and I'm just going&nbsp;
to be elsewhere for the next period of time&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:37.760 --> 00:03:44.320
y chance it you know that. That's my approach. And&nbsp;
then just one last thing. This is also part of why&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:44.320 --> 00:03:51.040
the Electoral College should really be gotten rid&nbsp;
of. Biden won by about eight million votes, but&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:51.600 --> 00:03:57.920
about 100000 votes in a few swing states were&nbsp;
the margin that provided the electoral victory.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:58.880 --> 00:04:05.920
The electoral victory seems much more plausibly&nbsp;
overturning when it comes down to 100000 votes&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:05.920 --> 00:04:13.440
in a handful of states, whereas how do you&nbsp;
even plausibly claim to try to circumvent an&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:13.440 --> 00:04:21.680
eight million vote loss? Just another signal about&nbsp;
the the importance of continuing to fight to get&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:21.680 --> 00:04:25.440
rid of the Electoral College. And that's even a&nbsp;
separate issue than the Electoral College helps&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:25.440 --> 00:04:31.440
Republican president. Yes, it does. But regardless&nbsp;
